---
title: MediSense AI - IoT Ingestion to Anomaly to DPA
---
flowchart TD
    W([Samsung Watch]) --> BLE[BLE gateway]
    BLE --> K{Kafka reachable?}
    K -- no --> BUF[Buffer to NDJSON /tmp - drain every 5m]
    K -- yes --> KC[kafka_consumer.py consume iot-vitals]
    BUF --> KC
    KC --> DB[(Persist BiometricReading)]
    DB --> AD[anomaly_detector.ingest_reading<br/>Redis 5m + 60m sliding windows]
    AD --> M{Greater than 5 points?}
    M -- no --> END1([wait for more])
    M -- yes --> SC[LSTM score 5m critical + 60m trend]
    SC --> G1{score_5m critical?}
    G1 -- yes --> P1[FCM push + WebSocket to doctors]
    G1 -- no --> G2{trend greater than 0.60?}
    G2 -- yes --> DPA[Generate DPA summary - PENDING]
    G2 -- no --> END2([store only])
    P1 --> DOC([Doctor reviews on dashboard])
    DPA --> DOC
    DOC --> DEC{Approve / Reject}
    DEC --> AUD[Audit log + status update]
